id = &"mw7_monofilament_whip"
display_name = "MW-7 Monofilament Whip"
description = "A reel on the back of the right wrist pays out six and a half metres of monomolecular filament with a tungsten bead on the end. Whatever it crosses at speed is cut: limbs, heads, bodies. Select it on the D-pad, LB to draw it or reel it in. Hold LT: the view holds still and the right stick swings the whip. RT lashes across the crosshair."
